  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1139\">\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1088\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1086\">&lt;20 IU/mL (Negative):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1139\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1139\">\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1139\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No significant IgA rheumatoid factor detected.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1325\">\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1187\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1185\">20&ndash;40 IU/mL (Borderline/Low Positive):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1325\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1274\">\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1274\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May be seen in <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1271\">early RA, chronic infections, or other autoimmune conditions</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1325\">\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1325\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Correlate with anti-CCP and clinical features.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1562\">\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1356\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1354\">&gt;40 IU/mL (Positive):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1562\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1461\">\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1461\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Suggestive of <strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1399\">Rheumatoid Arthritis</strong>, especially if anti-CCP is positive and symptoms correlate.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1562\">\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1562\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Higher titers may be associated with <strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1537\">extra-articular manifestations</strong> and more severe disease.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
